WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.956 --> 00:00:02.192
Hello everyone!

00:00:02.192 --> 00:00:07.542
In this short video, as you can see and hear,

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:09.232
I am speaking Hungarian.

00:00:10.442 --> 00:00:14.222
It is my first video in Hungarian

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:16.363
so I truly hope that

00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:20.643
especially native Hungarian speakers

00:00:20.643 --> 00:00:24.443
will understand everything.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:26.263
First of all,

00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:29.991
I won't speak about

00:00:29.991 --> 00:00:32.381
how I have learned Hungarian,

00:00:32.381 --> 00:00:34.841
and I won't ask

00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:37.871
if I am doing fine or not.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:41.101
This is not the main goal of the video.

00:00:41.101 --> 00:00:43.154
The main goal of this video is

00:00:43.154 --> 00:00:46.301
that I'd like to show you

00:00:46.301 --> 00:00:47.753
how important it is

00:00:47.753 --> 00:00:51.633
to make the right decisions,

00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:56.933
and how to stay motivated.

00:00:56.933 --> 00:01:01.823
In particular, I'd like to talk about

00:01:01.823 --> 00:01:08.300
WHY I have learned Hungarian

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.180
three years ago,

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:20.924
and why I kept and will keep learning it with time.

00:01:20.924 --> 00:01:24.102
I have heard quite often that

00:01:24.102 --> 00:01:26.851
Hungarian is not a useful language,

00:01:26.851 --> 00:01:31.143
that it is spoken just in Hungary.

00:01:31.143 --> 00:01:34.679
That even those foreigners who live in Hungary

00:01:34.679 --> 00:01:36.853
don't learn Hungarian,

00:01:36.853 --> 00:01:39.061
and that they only speak English,

00:01:39.061 --> 00:01:42.419
be it in Budapest or in Hungary in general.

00:01:42.419 --> 00:01:47.520
And as if it were not enough,

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:51.457
a lot of people think that

00:01:51.457 --> 00:01:56.267
the Hungarian language is very...too difficult.

00:01:56.267 --> 00:02:04.809
After spending some time in Hungary,

00:02:04.809 --> 00:02:08.664
and after living wonderful experiences,

00:02:08.664 --> 00:02:18.237
I fully realized that I really wanted to learn to speak Hungarian fluently.

00:02:18.237 --> 00:02:23.063
And that's a key point, that is

00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:28.578
we have to have strong reasons

00:02:28.578 --> 00:02:31.591
for learning a language,

00:02:31.591 --> 00:02:38.893
and that we don't have to pay any mind

00:02:38.893 --> 00:02:41.494
to what others say.

